**Unbuilt, unrun and not integrated. Root review must precede any SDK configure,
target build or QEMU invocation.** Previous prep01 and passing host/config
campaigns and earlier eight-variant target-prep01 remain immutable. Its eight
variants did not include actual reserve-off targets. This new prep02 adds both
